Iterates through the list from right to left. If an adjacent pair where `nums[i] > nums[i + 1]` is encountered, the element `nums[i]` is replaced by `spf[nums[i]]` and rechecked against `nums[i + 1]`, returning -1 if it remains greater. If the list is already sorted in non-decreasing order, returns 0.

